<title>HONG KONG: Bear Stearns sets warrants on Guangnan.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns sets warrants on Guangnan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bear Stearns Companies Inc said on Friday it issued 170 million American style call warrants on shares of Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$10.44    PREMIUM	 16 pct</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.3016   GEARING	 3.85X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.APR.98   MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$11.60    LISTING DATE  22.05.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
